<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $1.00-2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $1.00-2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were active, prices were $1.00 to $2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - load uniformly choice 2-4 1300 lbs 68.50. Otherwise, select to choice 1000-1350 lbs 66.00-68.00. Select 64.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 975-1200 lbs 65.50-67.50, some off above steers 68.00. Select 64.00-65.50.</p>
</text>
